where \eqn{i} indexes the tile, \eqn{j} the pixel nested within the tile,
\eqn{k} the age, and
\eqn{g(age) = e^{-\beta_4 age}(1 - e^{-\beta_2 age})^{\beta_3}}{g(age) = exp(-beta4 * age) * (1 - exp(-beta2 * age))^beta3} is the
