tile) random-effect variance and \eqn{\hat\sigma^2_\epsilon}{sigma2_e_hat} is the
estimated residual variance. The
\eqn{\hat\sigma^2_\epsilon / \hat\sigma^2_b}{sigma2_e_hat / sigma2_b_hat} term shrinks weak local
